=== Glass Unit ===
id: routes.webhooks
version: 0.1.0
language: typescript

=== Intent ===
purpose: Inbound webhook handlers for external services. The Telegram webhook receives messages from linked users and creates journal entries. Supports text, photos, voice, audio, and video messages. Also handles account linking via ephemeral codes.
source:
  kind: prd
  reference: "PRD Section 8 — Messaging Integration"
parent: index
stakeholder: user
subIntents: []
approvalStatus: approved

=== Contract ===
requires:
  - "TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET configured and registered with Telegram via setWebhook"
  - "TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN configured for outbound Telegram API calls"
  - "KV binding available for linking code lookup and rate limiting"
guarantees:
  on_success:
    - "Telegram webhook validates X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token header"
    - "/start command sends welcome message with linking instructions"
    - "8-char alphanumeric codes are matched against KV, linking chat ID to user on match"
    - "Linked users' messages create journal entries with appropriate entryType (text, audio, photo, video)"
    - "Media attachments downloaded from Telegram and stored in R2"
    - "Text content polished via AI when available"
    - "Voice/audio/video messages are transcribed via Workers AI Whisper; transcript becomes rawContent"
    - "Photos without captions have no rawContent and skip AI polish"
    - "Entry created before processing_log writes so FK references are valid"
    - "Polished content updated on the entry after AI processing completes"
    - "Journal processing runs in background via waitUntil to avoid webhook timeout"
    - "Immediate acknowledgment sent with personality-aware message via getStaticEntrySavedAck"
    - "Follow-up message sent with personality-aware transcription status via getStaticTranscriptionCompleteMsg"
    - "Active habit check-in session intercepted before journal entry processing"
    - "Habit check-in responses parsed as yes/no (y/n/yes/no/t/f/1/0, case-insensitive)"
    - "Valid response records habit log via upsertHabitLog"
    - "After recording, streak computed via getHabitStreak"
    - "Personality-aware response generated via generateHabitResponse with streak data"
    - "If not completed and consecutiveMisses >= 7, auto-cleanup offered (pendingCleanup)"
    - "Cleanup cooldown: 30 days since last_cleanup_offered_at"
    - "Pending cleanup yes deactivates habit; no defers with lastCleanupOfferedAt update"
    - "After final question, session deleted from KV and personality-aware summary sent"
    - "Accountability insight generated as non-blocking follow-up after check-in completes (via waitUntil)"
    - "/cancel command sends personality-aware cancel message via getStaticCancelMsg"
    - "Unrecognized responses during check-in send personality-aware prompt via getStaticInvalidResponseMsg"
    - "Cleanup offer uses personality-aware message via getStaticCleanupOffer"
    - "Cleanup response uses personality-aware message via getStaticCleanupResponse"
    - "Check-in summary line uses personality-aware message via getStaticCheckinSummaryLine"
  on_failure:
    - "Invalid webhook secret returns 403"
    - "Unlinked users receive instructional message"
    - "Files exceeding Telegram's 20MB download limit are detected before download and user is notified"
    - "Telegram getFile failures are logged with descriptive error"
    - "Media download failures logged but do not prevent entry creation"
    - "AI polish failures fall back to raw content"
    - "Transcription failures do not prevent entry creation"
    - "Habit check-in KV failures fall through to normal journal entry processing"
invariants:
  - "Webhook always returns { ok: true } to Telegram (except auth failure)"
  - "Linking codes deleted from KV after successful use"
  - "Linking attempts rate-limited to 10 per hour per chat ID"
  - "Entry date set to current UTC date (no time component)"
  - "Habit check-in state stored in KV with key habit_checkin:{chatId}"
  - "Check-in intercept occurs after user lookup, before journal entry processing"
advisories:
  - "POST /api/webhooks/lulu returns 501 Not Implemented (Phase 2 placeholder)"
fails:
  InvalidSignature: "Return 403 — webhook secret mismatch"
